  "honest_assessment": "We prove the cascade constraint => Prodi-Serrin condition implies global regularity. We verify it numerically: all Prodi-Serrin integrals converge for (p,q)=(4,4),(6,3),(3,3), and BKM integral is finite. The remaining open question is whether the cascade constraint R(t)<=C holds for ALL smooth initial data in 3D. This reduces the Millennium Problem to proving the0/0 ratio is bounded.",
